ac\"><span class=\"top\">2</span><span class=\"bottom\">19</span></span>\n      ＝<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"top\">7</span><span class=\"bottom\">19</span></span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"hand answer ans21\">\n      答：红球比黄球多占玻璃球总数的<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"top\">7</span><span class=\"bottom\">19</span></span>。\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"red-check check21\"></div>\n\n    <div class=\"question sub2 printed\">\n      （2）黄球和蓝球一共占玻璃球总数的几分之几？\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"hand work22a\">\n      黄：<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"top\">2</span><span class=\"bottom\">19</span></span>\n      &nbsp;蓝：<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"top\">8</span><span class=\"bottom\">19</span></span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"hand work22b\">\n      <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"top\">2</span><span class=\"bottom\">19</span></span>\n      ＋<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"top\">8</span><span class=\"bottom\">19</span></span>\n      ＝<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"top\">10</span><span class=\"bottom\">19</span></span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"hand answer ans22\">\n      答：黄球和蓝球一共占玻璃球总数的<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"top\">10</span><span class=\"bottom\">19</span></span>。\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"red-check check22\"></div>\n\n    <div class=\"question sub3 printed\">\n      （3）请你再提出一个和分数相关的数学问题，并解答。\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"hand made-question\">蓝球比红球少占玻璃球总数的几分之几？</div>\n    <div class=\"hand work23\">\n      <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"top\">9</span><span class=\"bottom\">19</span></span>\n      －<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"top\">8</span><span class=\"bottom\">19</span></span>\n      ＝<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"top\">1</span><span class=\"bottom\">19</span></span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"hand answer ans23\">\n      答：蓝球比红球少占玻璃球总数的<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"top\">1</span><span class=\"bottom\">19</span></span>。\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"red-check check23\"></div>\n\n    <div class=\"question q3